	(text "Max power 1.8W, therfore\npeak = 7.8 V / 80 Ohms = 97.5 mA (Absolute Min needed to activate) \n+= 20mA (Adjust based on IRL performace)\n\nhold = 1.2 V / 80 Ohms = 15 mA (Absolute Min needed to hold) \n+= 20mA (Adjust with IRL tests)\n"
