	(text "Change after IRL testing, data sheet does not offer this value.\nI_{PEAK} = 250mA / R_{HOLD} * 66.67kOhms < R_{HOLD} < 250kOhms\n\nI_{PEAK} = 150 mA -> 110 kOhms"
