	(text "Min OSC Freq needs to be higher than audible ~= 25kHz\nf_{PWM} = 60 kHz / R_{OSC} * 66.67 kOhms; 160kOhms < R_{OSC} < 2 MOhms\nf_{PWM} = 22 kHz\nR_{OSC} = 181k ~= 182k"
